sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Setup as SetupScreen / Settings
    participant Manager as BackupManager
    participant SAF as Storage Access Framework (SAF)
    participant Handlers as BackupModuleHandlers
    participant Room as RollerSkaterDatabase (v8)

    alt Export Flow
        User->>Setup: Tap "Create Backup"
        Setup->>SAF: ACTION_CREATE_DOCUMENT (.json / .rsk)
        SAF-->>Setup: Output Document Uri
        Setup->>Manager: createBackup(uri)
        Manager->>Handlers: Collect Playlists, Favorites, EQ, Stats, Bookmarks, Prefs
        Handlers->>Room: Query entities
        Room-->>Handlers: Entities
        Handlers-->>Manager: JSON DTOs
        Manager->>SAF: Serialize formatted JSON archive
        Manager-->>User: Backup Export Completed
    else Restore Flow
        User->>Setup: Select Backup File (SAF Document Uri)
        Setup->>Manager: inspectBackup(uri)
        Manager-->>Setup: BackupManifest (version, date, available modules)
        Setup->>User: Display module selection checklist
        User->>Setup: Confirm selection
        Setup->>Manager: restoreSelectedModules(plan)
        Manager->>Handlers: Deserialize and validate payload
        Handlers->>Room: Fuzzy match MediaStore IDs by relative path & title
        Handlers->>Room: Non-destructive merge / insert into Room tables
        Room-->>Setup: Restore Complete
        Setup-->>User: Success Notification
    end
